{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，flavor='seurat_v3' 的输入要求是 count 数据，而不是 library_normalized_log1p 矩阵。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "当前矩阵状态为 library_normalized_log1p，不满足 seurat_v3 对 count 数据的输入要求，因此不能直接作为输入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "seurat_v3 会先对每个基因做带正则化标准差的 z-score 标准化，再计算标准化方差并按此排序。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "First, the data are standardized (i.e., z-score normalization per feature) with a regularized standard deviation. Next, the normalized variance is computed as the variance of each gene after the transformation. Genes are ranked by the normalized variance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：n_top_genes 在 flavor='seurat_v3' 下是必需参数，但这是参数存在性要求，不代表可以绕过 count 数据输入要求。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "n_top_genes\n        Number of highly-variable genes to keep. Mandatory if `flavor='seurat_v3'`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "由于未提供 counts 层，无法判断是否存在可用的原始计数矩阵；需要先确认是否有未归一化的 counts 数据。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": "当前 AnnData 中是否保留了未归一化的原始 counts 层或 raw counts？"
}
